            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>The app no longer crashes when you preview a video and then move to another</b> file.<b> A change in how recent macOS versions analyze video frames could crash</b> the app while a video preview was closing; that analysis is now turned off for previews. Video playback is unaffected.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
